### listar todos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### listar por categoría (Placas de Video)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?categoryId=674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345

### categoryId inválido
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?categoryId=no-es-un-id

### categoryId bien formado sin productos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?categoryId=674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012348

### crear
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RTX 4070",
  "description": "Placa de video para gaming",
  "price": 800,
  "stock": 5,
  "status": "disponible",
  "categoryId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345"
}

### crear sin categoría existente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RTX 4070",
  "description": "Placa de video para gaming",
  "price": 800,
  "stock": 5,
  "status": "disponible",
  "categoryId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012348"
}

### crear con precio inválido
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RTX 4070",
  "description": "Placa de video para gaming",
  "price": 0,
  "stock": 5,
  "status": "disponible",
  "categoryId": "674a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345"
}
